                        "message":  "Fix 18 lß╗ùi\n\nNEW] PageResponse.java](file:///d:/Visual%20studio%20code/eoffice-be/src/main/java/vn/edu/epu/eoffice_be/common/dto/PageResponse.java)\nDTO ph├ón trang chuß║⌐n h├│a vß╗¢i content, page, size, totalElements, totalPages, first, last\nFactory method PageResponse.from(Page\u003cT\u003e) ─æß╗â chuyß╗ân ─æß╗òi tß╗½ Spring Data Page\n[MODIFY]\nDocumentBookController.java\nClass-level: @PreAuthorize(\"isAuthenticated()\") cho tß║Ñt cß║ú endpoint\nEndpoint tß║ío/sß╗¡a/─æ├│ng/mß╗ƒ/x├│a sß╗ò: @PreAuthorize(\"hasAnyRole(\u0027ADMIN\u0027, \u0027SYSTEM_ADMIN\u0027, \u0027LEADER\u0027)\")\nEndpoint cß║Ñp sß╗æ: @PreAuthorize(\"... or hasAuthority(\u0027DOCUMENT_ASSIGN_NUMBER\u0027)\")\nGET list: Trß║ú vß╗ü BaseResponse\u003cPageResponse\u003cDocumentBookResponse\u003e\u003e thay v├¼ Page trß╗▒c tiß║┐p\nPOST create: Th├¬m @ResponseStatus(HttpStatus.CREATED) v├á cß║¡p nhß║¡t @ApiResponse sang 201\n[MODIFY]\nDocumentBookCreateRequest.java\nTh├¬m @Positive cho documentTypeId v├á orgNodeId\nSiß║┐t regex numberPattern: ^\\\\{NUM\\\\}\\\\/[A-Za-z0-9├Ç-ß╗╣]+-[A-Za-z0-9├Ç-ß╗╣]+$ (chß╗ë ─æ├║ng 2 ph├ón ─æoß║ín, dß║Ñu -)\nTh├¬m @Size(max = 255) cho numberPattern\n[MODIFY]\nDocumentBookUpdateRequest.java\nC├╣ng regex mß╗¢i cho numberPattern\nTh├¬m @Size(max = 255) cho numberPattern\n[MODIFY]\nDocumentBookFilterRequest.java\nGhi ─æ├¿ pageable() ─æß╗â lu├┤n th├¬m tie-breaker id DESC v├áo cuß╗æi sort\nTh├¬m \"id\" v├áo getAllowedSortFields()\n[MODIFY]\nDocumentBook.java\n─Éß╗òi sang sequence ri├¬ng document_books_seq (allocationSize=50)\nKhai b├ío hß║▒ng sß╗æ LEVEL_INSTITUTION = 1, LEVEL_DEPARTMENT = 2\nTh├¬m @Min(1) @Max(2) cho bookLevel\nTh├¬m @PrePersist bß║úo vß╗ç currentNumber v├á isClosed khß╗Åi NULL\n[NEW]\n2026-09-14_add-document-books-sequence.yml\nMigration Liquibase tß║ío document_books_seq (startValue: 10000, incrementBy: 50)\n─É├ú ─æ─âng k├╜ v├áo master.yml v├á master-test.yml\n[MODIFY]\nDocumentBookRepository.java\nTh├¬m @Transact